          "field": "original_name",
          "value": "Super Bonk",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "The fourth game in the regular \"Bonk\" caveman series, Bonk is back on his first Super Nintendo outing.\n\nIn this side-scrolling platformer adventure, the gameplay is similar to Bonk 3. Super Bonk allows Bonk to travel through time from his prehistoric levels, the insides of a dinosaur, a version of modern Chinatown, and even the moon! Along the way, Bonk can find power-ups that can change his form to creatures such as a shooting Bonk crab, a dinosaur form called \"Big Kronk\", find candies that change his size from tiny to huge, travel through transportation tubes, and find multiple bonus levels.\n\nBonk still uses his head to smash his enemies, propeller seeds that allow Bonk to fly, and for the first time, can carry spring flowers on his head in his continuing battle against his arch nemesis, King Drool!",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "El cuarto juego de la serie de cavernícolas «Bonk», que regresa en su primera aventura para Super Nintendo.\n\nEn esta aventura de plataformas de desplazamiento lateral, la jugabilidad es similar a la de Bonk 3. Super Bonk permite a Bonk viajar en el tiempo desde sus niveles prehistóricos, al interior de un dinosaurio, a una versión del barrio chino moderno e incluso a la Luna. En el camino, Bonk puede encontrar potenciadores que transforman su forma en criaturas como un cangrejo Bonk que dispara, una forma de dinosaurio llamada «Big Kronk», caramelos que cambian su tamaño de diminuto a enorme, tubos de transporte y múltiples niveles de bonificación.\n\nBonk sigue usando la cabeza para aplastar a sus enemigos, semillas con hélice que le permiten volar y, por primera vez, puede llevar flores de primavera en la cabeza en su continua batalla contra su archienemigo, el Rey Drool.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "year",
          "value": "1994",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        }
      ],
