        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Bonk's Adventure was developed by Red Company and Atlus and released on the TurboGrafx-16 in 1989 before being ported to the NES, Game Boy and Amiga. It is a 2D platform game that became quite popular, with subsequent remakes and sequels spawning from the game. It was later included in Nintendo's Virtual Console service as well as the PlayStation Store.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "Bonk's Adventure fue desarrollado por Red Company y Atlus y lanzado para TurboGrafx-16 en 1989; después se adaptó a NES, Game Boy y Amiga. Es un juego de plataformas en 2D que se volvió bastante popular, y del que surgieron posteriores remakes y secuelas. Más tarde se incluyó en el servicio Virtual Console de Nintendo, así como en PlayStation Store.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
